{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-observe#card-zh","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-observe","commit":"39c0343fdaf20721350058a96dc4c422984c498c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-observe 是 DeepSeek Harness 的后台可观测性导出插件，将会话事件转为 OTLP traces 与 metrics，也支持 Langfuse。它监听 turn、step、工具调用和 LLM 生成，记录关联 spans、token 与成本指标，并在发送前脱敏和截断文本。插件提供异步批量、失败重试、有界离线缓冲，以及可选的状态查询和运行时开关。适合需要追踪模型调用与工具耗时的 DSH 用户。默认关闭，启用时需配置至少一个后端；持久缓冲依赖 DSH storageDomain。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:151-162","src/index.ts:184-207","src/pipeline.ts:95-145","src/sanitize.ts:86-109"]}
{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-observe#card-en","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-observe","commit":"39c0343fdaf20721350058a96dc4c422984c498c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-observe exports DSH traces and metrics to OTLP or Langfuse. It records turn, step, tool, and LLM spans plus token and cost metrics, sanitizing text before export. Batching, retries, bounded offline buffering, and optional remote status controls support delivery. Export is disabled by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:151-162","src/index.ts:184-207","src/pipeline.ts:95-145","src/sanitize.ts:86-109"]}
